{
 "about": "Disgaea RPG units usable as outfits of the game's unique characters (DRPG Assets (Updated)/Units IDs.txt). class: the character's char.dat id (= its sprite); twin: the DRPG unit drawn exactly like the character's own sprite (its own idle / skill poses are learned from it, drpgmap.learn_unique); outfits: [DRPG unit, outfit name]. Forms the game already has (Pure Flonne, Tyrant Valvatorez, Sister Artina, Awakened Rozalin) and monster-type DRPG units are left out. Built by tools/drpg_outfits.py. kind 'new_character': a new recruitable humanoid character copied from character `class` (stats, aptitudes, evilities; `skills` replace the learnset), drawn from DRPG `unit` with `template`'s animation set, recruited by `quest`; `outfits` attach to it (Usalia: the game's Usalia rides her companion and is a monster-type unit, her humanoid DRPG variants are their own character; Liezerota: the game's is an NPC without skills or attack frames, `stats_from` gives the new character another character's base stats and aptitudes).",
